<div class="q-l-band">
  <div class="q-l-shell">
    <nav class="q-l-nav">
      <QuorumWeb.Brand.logo size={24} />
      <div class="q-l-nav-links">
        <a href="#how-it-works">How it works</a>
        <a href="#for-presenters">For presenters</a>
        <.link href={~p"/start"} class="q-button q-button--ink">Start a room</.link>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="q-l-band">
  <div class="q-l-shell">
    <section class="q-l-hero">
      <div>
        <h1>Take live questions from the room.</h1>
        <p class="q-l-hero-sub">
          Project a code, have your audience post and vote from their seats, and answer the top questions.
        </p>

        <div class="q-l-code-card">
          <label class="q-label" for="code">Have a code?</label>
          <form class="q-l-code-row" action={~p"/join"} method="get">
            <input
              id="code"
              name="code"
              class="q-input"
              maxlength="5"
              autocapitalize="characters"
              autocomplete="off"
              spellcheck="false"
              placeholder={@demo.code}
            />
            <button type="submit" class="q-button">Join a session</button>
          </form>
          <p class="q-meta">No account. You remain anonymous unless you choose otherwise.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="q-l-mock">
        <div class="q-l-projection q-projection q-projection--dark">
          <div style="text-align:left;"><QuorumWeb.Brand.logo on_dark size={19} /></div>
          <p style="font:400 15px var(--q-font-sans);color:var(--q-on-dark-muted);margin:16px 0 0;">
            Scan to ask a question
          </p>
          <div class="q-l-projection-qr">{raw(qr(@demo.code, 148))}</div>
          <p class="q-code" style="font-size:44px;margin:0;">{@demo.code}</p>
          <div class="q-l-projection-stats">
            <span><strong>{@demo.connected}</strong> connected</span>
            <span><strong>{@demo.posted}</strong> questions</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="q-l-feed-card"
          id="q-example"
          data-rotate-ms="5000"
          data-examples={Jason.encode!(QuorumWeb.LandingExamples.all())}
        >
          <div class="q-l-feed-vote">
            <svg width="13" height="10" viewBox="0 0 15 12" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M7.5 1 L14 11 L1 11 Z" fill="currentColor" />
            </svg>
            <span style="font:700 14px var(--q-font-sans);margin-top:2px;" data-example="votes">
              {@example.votes}
            </span>
          </div>
          <div style="min-width:0;">
            <p
              class="q-question"
              style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;margin:0;"
              data-example="body"
            >
              {@example.body}
            </p>
            <p class="q-meta" style="margin:6px 0 0;" data-example="meta">
              {QuorumWeb.LandingExamples.asker(@example.name)}, {@example_age}
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="q-l-band q-l-band--sunken">
  <div class="q-l-shell">
    <section class="q-l-demo">
      <div>
        <div class="q-label" style="font-size:16px;">Demo room, code {@demo.code}</div>
        <p class="q-meta" style="margin:4px 0 0;">
          {String.capitalize(count(@demo.posted, "question", "questions"))} posted, {word(
            @demo.answered
          )} answered. Open two views side by side to see the queue update.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="q-l-demo-actions">
        <.link href={~p"/demo"} class="q-button">Join as a student</.link>
        <.link href={~p"/demo/host"} class="q-button q-button--secondary">Join as a presenter</.link>
        <.link href={~p"/demo/project"} class="q-button q-button--secondary">
          Open the projection
        </.link>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="q-l-band" id="how-it-works">
  <div class="q-l-shell">
    <section class="q-l-section">
      <h2>How it works</h2>
      <div class="q-l-cols" style="margin-top:44px;">
        <div>
          <h3>Project the code</h3>
          <p>Open a room and project a QR code on-screen for quick, easy access.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Students ask and vote</h3>
          <p>One tap to join, no account needed. Questions are anonymous by default.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Answer the top ones</h3>
          <p>Spotlight top-voted questions in the queue and work your way down the list.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="q-l-band q-l-band--sunken">
  <div class="q-l-shell">
    <section class="q-l-section q-l-split">
      <div>
        <h2>Add reading suggestions for offline learning</h2>
        <p>
          Attach your reading list to a room or lesson. When a student posts a question, Quorum
          points them at items from that list.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="q-l-pointer">
        <p class="q-question" style="font-size:17px;margin:0;">
          Is Nagel's bat argument about knowledge or about ontology?
        </p>
        <div class="q-l-pointer-block">
          <div class="q-label" style="margin-bottom:8px;">
            While you wait, from your course reading list
          </div>
          <p class="q-meta" style="margin:0;line-height:1.7;">
            <span class="q-l-pointer-link">Nagel, What Is It Like to Be a Bat?</span>, pp. 435 to 441<br />
            <span class="q-l-pointer-link">Lecture 6 slides</span>, the epistemic gap section
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="q-l-band" id="for-presenters">
  <div class="q-l-shell">
    <section class="q-l-section">
      <div class="q-l-cols q-l-cols--two">
        <div>
          <h3>In the hall</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Readable from the back row, lit or dark.</li>
            <li>Works on any phone with a browser.</li>
            <li>Keyboard shortcuts for the queue.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Setup</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>No student accounts, roster upload, or install needed.</li>
            <li>Close rooms at a set time or keep them open longer.</li>
            <li>Questions are kept after the session, so a term of them reads back.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="q-l-band q-l-band--sunken">
  <div class="q-l-shell">
    <section class="q-l-cta">
      <div>
        <h2 style="font:700 32px var(--q-font-sans);margin:0 0 6px;">Start a room</h2>
        <p class="q-meta" style="font-size:15px;">See Quorum in action</p>
      </div>
      <div class="q-l-cta-actions">
        <.link href={~p"/start"} class="q-button">Start a room</.link>
        <.link href={~p"/demo"} class="q-button q-button--secondary">See a demo session</.link>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>

<footer class="q-l-shell q-l-footer">
  <QuorumWeb.Brand.logo size={20} />
  <nav class="q-shell-nav" aria-label="Site">
    <.link navigate={~p"/privacy"}>Privacy</.link>
    <.link navigate={~p"/accessibility"}>Accessibility</.link>
    <.link navigate={~p"/contact"}>Contact</.link>
  </nav>
</footer>
